ted = parseable and normalized_gain >= threshold\n        if accepted:\n            accepted_call_ids.append(call_id)\n        diagnostics.append({\n            \"accepted\": accepted,\n            \"call_id\": call_id,\n            \"normalized_gain\": normalized_gain\n        })\n    return {\n        \"accepted_call_ids\": accepted_call_ids,\n        \"diagnostics\": diagnostics\n    }\n```\n\nThis should work.\n\nNow encode as JSON string. Need to escape quotes and backslashes. Use triple quotes in Python but output as string.\n\nI'll create the response as a JSON object with key \"implementation\" and value the source code as a string.\n\nLet's construct carefully."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":2171,"completion_tokens":974,"total_tokens":3145,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":2048},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":723},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":2048,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":123},"system_fingerprint":"fp_8b330d02d0_prod0820_fp8_kvcache_20260402"}